        "original_id": "3cdbd932-0c78-54d5-8e1c-d9afe46e069a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dylan Everett, Dean Winchester, Hunter Brochu, Ridge Canipe, Nicolai Lawton-Giustra, Brock Kelly, Chad Everett\n- TV series: How To Be Indie, Wingin' It, Open Heart\n- Character: Dean Winchester\n- Companies: Epitome Pictures, DHX Media, marblemedia\n\nFacts:\n- Dylan Everett is best known for roles in the TV series How To Be Indie (2009–2011), Wingin' It (2010–2013), an unnamed 2012–2013 series, and Open Heart (2015).\n- Open Heart is a 2015 American-Canadian mystery-drama television series.\n- Open Heart was produced by Epitome Pictures, a unit of DHX Media, in association with marblemedia.\n- Dean Winchester has been portrayed in other versions by Hunter Brochu as a toddler, Ridge Canipe as a child, Nicolai Lawton-Giustra as a pre-teen, Brock Kelly and Dylan Everett as teens, and Chad Everett as an elderly version.",
